{"server":"tw","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_06_beg","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_06","title":"群英薈萃","storyCode":"CW-6","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"9916b85ea6d450457eab964ec5c75bf89e5acf6ff90192192b905f58641bd945","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塞雷婭大戰霍爾海雅。軍方全面入侵實驗室。過去如同潮水，險些淹沒了迷迭香。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"花......好漂亮呀。\n你又來看我了嗎？今天的花我不認識，你能不能教我怎麼拼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，納西莎。你學會之後，想做什麼呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"和以前一樣，我想把這些花瓣留下來，放進我的畫本裡。\n媽媽最喜歡花，爸爸和你一樣，懂很多植物知識。\n雖然他們都不在了，但我想把這些新認識的花都記錄下來，等去墓園的時候，講給他們聽。\n你會帶我去的，對嗎？很快就要到四月了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納西莎，我的好孩子，你總是最堅強的那一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來吧，先把花放在那邊的桌子上。等我忙完，我就教你拼寫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"好香。今天吃什麼呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼過來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快去那邊乖乖坐好。今天我們吃你最愛的馬鈴薯湯。"},{"type":"narration","text":"好餓。能不能切快一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要不要自己試試看？沒關係的，不要害怕，我來握住你的手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"像......這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，孩子。你做得很好。你以後還會做得更好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"以後？是不是長大以後？我也會長得跟你一樣高，一樣有力氣，變成很厲害的科學家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你會比我更厲害，厲害得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納西莎，後腦的傷口還痛嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"不痛了。\n哥哥們給了我很多糖吃。他們說，每天晚上睡覺之前吃一片，就不會感覺到痛，而且還會做棉花糖一樣的夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乖孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吃完飯之後，把這幾片糖也吃掉，好不好？我想帶你去一個地方。"},{"type":"narration","text":"走廊那邊嗎？\n是不是哥哥們昨天去的地方？\n他們說那裡有一座很好看的植物園，就和你唸的那些童話故事書裡寫的一樣，你每次帶來撫養院的花都是從那裡採的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"熟悉的影子","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"進過那座植物園的，都會變成最被命運寵愛的孩子。"},{"type":"narration","text":"走廊的盡頭是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"迷迭香。\nRosmontis是誰？\n納西莎......又是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在等我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自始至終。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士他們去哪裡了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們留在原地。這場審判不需要多餘的旁觀者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說這裡是法庭。那原告和被告都是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，洛肯·威廉姆斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在命運即將吞噬我的這最後一刻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懇請你，來旁觀我的一生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此時此地，我承認我所有的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貪婪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。我的老師也曾這麼痛斥過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他斥責我的冒進，認為我從將死之人身上摘取感染器官的行徑既違背法律，又有悖人倫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他認為我不僅沒有幫到病人，反而加速了他們的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他們本就快死了，甚至就連意識都不再清醒。我無意製造更多痛苦，也並未扭轉他們的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而老師並不認同我的觀點。在一場毫無公正可言的私下審判中，他和他的老師一起宣判了我在學術界的死刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不願承認，對於一名科學家來說，“貪婪”更像是一種美德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個在小鎮長大的孩子，從小受過的生物學教育僅限於如何為馱獸接生，除非他能夠鼓起勇氣，在半夜偷偷對剛出生的幼獸揮動解剖刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，對知識的渴望足以壓抑他共情生命的本能。他必須抓住一切機會，不斷不斷地攀登，才能繼續在這條路上求索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怯懦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不常常缺乏勇氣，卻唯獨只為一件事情讓步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由於老師的舉報，梅蘭德給我下了禁令。這個可恥的烙印使得所有的大學和政府資助的研究機構都將我拒之門外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對一名正當盛年的科學家來說，這無疑是最殘酷的刑罰。他們剝奪了我繼續做研究的資格，等同於一次靈魂層面的謀殺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我甚至開始酗酒。長達一年零十個月的時間裡，我強迫自己直面顫抖的雙手，好忘掉沒法握住解剖刀的痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就是在那個時候找上我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們，最無恥的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"國防部。他們願意資助我成立洛肯水箱，條件是我必須在五年之內為他們製造出最有力的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"科學是中性、純粹且自由的，而實用價值——尤其是應用到武器研究的部分——只會拖累科學本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不願意為他們貢獻自己的研究，但他們掐住了我的軟肋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知識是昂貴的。我是一名實驗科學家，儀器、設備、材料，甚至實驗室的一磚一瓦，都需要錢來支撐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要達成夢想，建成一座符合條件的實驗室，遠比修建特里蒙市中心聳立的高樓更費錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不得不承認自己的軟弱，匍匐在他們的權威之下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個國家、這個時代難道不比我更可悲？他們竟能容忍最野蠻的力量掌握科學前進的命脈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況軍人先天是最為短視的人，他們掌著科學研究的舵，竟只想著把寶貴的知識應用到同類之間的互相廝殺上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愚蠢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，愚蠢。對於一名科學家來說，愚蠢確實是最不能夠被原諒的罪行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛說到了軍方那幫蠢貨。他們其實很好糊弄，幾億的投資換來可以植入皮下的施術單元，就能堵上他們的嘴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我那時候太忙了。我醉心於自己的研究，無視了身邊人的懦弱和野心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一個蠢笨的學生，竟然把我的實驗資料的一部分交給了國防部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，國防部知道了洛肯水箱真正研究的是什麼。他們迫不及待地想要看到成果，甚至以直接接管實驗室作為威脅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我正在完成這一生最接近成功的作品，我如何能容忍他們偷走我的夢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你冒了一次險，然後你失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一敗塗地。這次失敗讓你失去了所有東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納西莎毀掉了你的實驗室。這沒什麼，可是那該死的梅蘭德再度聞風而來。他們奪走了納西莎，又一次，剝奪了你的夢想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你成了一具行屍走肉，國防部收走了剩餘的廢銅爛鐵，又想向你討要過去的幾億投資。你還不上，也拒絕再配合他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“洛肯”","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，你被扔進了監獄，就像一塊腐爛的肉，再也無人問津。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我這一生犯過的最嚴重的罪行——失敗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我一生中最後也是最慘痛的失敗，就站在我面前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"納西莎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的花園裡，僅剩的未被埋入淤泥的花。殘缺，但依然美麗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請好好看看我，看清楚那個教養你、呵護你、壓迫你、戕害你的洛肯·威廉姆斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是見證者，見證過我幾乎就要攀登上頂點的輝煌，也見證過我跌向萬丈深淵的落魄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我邀請你，孩子。請你充當那把尺，去裁量我的痛苦，我的遺憾，我的罪惡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是唯一有資格的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進，推進！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哥倫比亞士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_901_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已壓制！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三隊四隊那邊怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵方動力甲數量不再增加！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，繼續進攻。做好突入建築的準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒有這麼快贏哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，先殺掉你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺掉你的話，是不是就能拖更長時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒？我們之前就是敵人，我背叛了誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是早該這麼做了？你可是險些殺死我們敬愛的副總統的人，拿下你的頭顱，說不定副總統先生還會給我一個額外赦免。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各單位......注意......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布萊克","speakerId":"avg_npc_899_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全力......進攻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想當烈士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許我真該成全你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？是你來啦，大英雄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍方和梅蘭德已經包圍了這棟建築，你們沒有勝算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不明白。我要的並不是勝利，而是一個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克麗斯騰也一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有什麼機會值得用這麼多人，包括你們自己的生命來換。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不值得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是和我擁有的知識相比，我自己的生命從來都不值一提。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我窺見過那麼多宏偉浩瀚的歷史，可對時間來說，我比一陣稍縱即逝的風還不如。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我的生命，我可憐的乏味的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣微不足道的一點時間，能換來我觸碰永恆真知的機會，哪怕只是短暫的一瞥——怎麼可能不值得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至對死都很狂熱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，我只是......好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道千萬種死法，橫亙成百上千年的歷史。可我自己只能體驗一次死亡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個突兀的句號，分隔了累積的記憶與書寫未來的可能性。那會是什麼感覺呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你會知道的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_ac15_9"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i03"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我輸了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣吧，塞雷婭。在這裡乾脆俐落地殺掉我。或者沒那麼乾脆也可以。反正只有一次機會，我願意再多體驗一會這特別的滋味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真是個......瘋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢？你該不會依然認定自己的所作所為全部發自理性吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭，你總想更高效地制止災難發生，那你已經站在門口了，為什麼不和軍方合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"軍隊才是最常把災難擴大化的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那梅蘭德呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在過去五年裡，梅蘭德始終是你堅定的盟友。他們做出了與軍方合作的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦，對了......還有那個可愛的黎博利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"褐色的小鳥，她是那樣地富有道德感和同情心。我剛剛還在軍方的飛行器裡看見她了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的表情原來也會出現在你的臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的手越來越無力了。所有事情都在脫離掌控，就連自己的心也一樣......類似感受對像你這樣的人來說，是不是特別陌生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的挑釁毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘖嘖，可憐的塞雷婭，你的眼睛，你的手，你全身上下都不是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不想立刻馬上現在就飛奔到那邊的實驗室去嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說不定......已經遲了哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只是短短一瞬間，霍爾海雅已經躍上了一旁半坍塌的高牆。\n連續幾次跳躍，她就離開了這片戰場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g7_mainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實驗室那邊的門被攻破了......怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛肯那傢伙......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，時間差不多也到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霍爾海雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_536_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就讓任務到此為止吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是洛肯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你會在每個周五的晚上來撫養院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你喜歡帶花過來，每次品種都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的衣服上總有一股很刺鼻的味道，就像游泳池，還有新刷的籬笆牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其實我不討厭這個味道，我想告訴你，不需要用花香來掩蓋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我沒有說，因為我喜歡你帶來的花，喜歡你給我講植物的故事。那會讓我想起爸爸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很好，好極了！你的記憶正在恢復！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我差不多快想起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你曾經對我很好很好，但你突然變得很壞很壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，孩子，對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我承諾過你......我想給你一個無限美好的未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的哥哥們，你們本該成為最完美的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們將重新定義源石技藝。你們將擺脫天賦的限制，不再受礦石病侵擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你們......不，我們本該一起戰勝命運本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？為什麼我沒能做到？是我毀掉了我們雙方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你哭了？為什麼要哭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"眼淚滴到了手上。很鹹的味道。很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"過去你也哭過，就在我面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那一天......不，我不要想起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不想要你留在我的回憶裡。忘記是痛苦的，但想起你更痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記住我。求你記住我。我就是那個罪人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"罪行累累。\n痛不欲生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......為什麼？為什麼！回憶在湧上來，我的頭好疼......好疼好疼......好冷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓住我的脖頸。用你的雙手，掐住它。感受到這跳動的血管了嗎？血是暖和的，你不會再冷了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血......怎麼會是暖和的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它比冰還冷，比水還要讓人窒息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你奪走了我的生活，還有我的哥哥們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把我變成了......變成了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"怪物。\n武器。\n毀滅者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就殺了我吧。毀滅我朽壞的身體，碾碎我罪惡的靈魂，來祭奠你失去的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺掉你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殺掉你，這所有的罪惡就會消失嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們不會再被你們奪取本該有的生活，都能和自己愛的人在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能再欺騙你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但至少，我罪有應得。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"洛肯","speakerId":"avg_npc_894_1","isRemote":false,"text":"時間不多了，很快我們就會迎來很多打擾者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去見他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不允許任何人......擋住正確的路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"29_g4_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，士兵們快要攻進來了——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須往更深的地方走，快呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"迷迭香。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不能拋下迷迭香。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"洛肯那老傢伙鎖了門！這棟建築的結構太特殊了，就跟迷宮差不多，一看就是娜斯提的傑作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經嘗試了十幾分鐘了，壓根搞不明白他們到底在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我也很擔心小貓......但洛肯那種病懨懨的科學家，大概動不了她吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他想找回迷迭香的記憶。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他想挑起迷迭香的憤怒。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"然後讓迷迭香殺死他。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這就是他所說的“禮物”。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他是終於失心瘋了嗎？我早聽說過在監獄裡待久了，人的精神都會變得很不正常的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......唔，我不知道這樣說好不好，洛肯曾經那樣對待過小貓，她也是有理由憤怒的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到伊芙芙的實驗記錄的時候，也很生氣很生氣，氣到想過一口氣把那個廢墟淹掉欸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說洛肯也算是惡有惡報吧。假設，只是假設啊，迷迭香真的考慮復仇的話，呃......我搞不清楚該以什麼立場阻止......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我只是不希望洛肯得逞。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我只是想看著迷迭香做想做的事。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我要找到她。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我想陪伴我的家人。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我想幫助我的幹員。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們只能抓緊時......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好險！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差點就和你一起被烤熟了欸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟了糟了，快躲過來一些——進來的是軍方的動力甲部隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我們得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是被震糊塗了嗎？博士，我怎麼好像聽見了伊芙芙的聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點，跟上我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼回事？行動這麼慢，沒訓練幾天的新兵菜鳥嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你才......新兵菜鳥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越聽越像......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三點鐘方向發現目標！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵？","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......原來是這麼用的？不行，太難用了，還不如我的火......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伊芙利特。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"真的是你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"動力甲在你們面前手腳扭曲地抽搐了幾下。\n伴隨著一陣火星劈啪亂竄，火紅的少女從裡面跳了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！還有繆繆？你們居然在一起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你會駕駛機甲？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"這不是據說很難的嗎？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都難不倒天才的本大爺！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，博士，這是塞雷婭改造過的，天才的是塞雷婭啦。具體細節你之後問她吧，她就在這附近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷婭......也來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":"avg_npc_895_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她要是能批准我單獨行動就好了，我巴不得呢！不過繆繆，你為什麼看起來不太高興？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"繆爾賽思","speakerId":"avg_249_mlyss_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是迷迭香消失的方向......動力甲去那邊了？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g5_rhinelab_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突入，突入！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現敵人——呃，是一名少女。感測器顯示，實驗室更深處還有一位老人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否繼續前......等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"飄浮在空中的巨型武器！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發現高威脅目標，進攻！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷冰冰的外衣......觸摸不到溫度，也感受不到情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們準備和壞人作戰嗎？你們和所有被傷害的人站在一起嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"報告，目標疑似未登記的危險實驗產物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是否立刻清除——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"動力甲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_526_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你沒有自己的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在行動之前，是不考慮對錯的，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你只是一具被操縱的傀儡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_391_rosmon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開。不然的話，我也會毀掉你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
